00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.700
for your right to party.

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.503
- Chug, chug it, chug it,
chug it, chug it, chug it.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:48.630
- That's why the legal drinking
age in Massachusetts is 21,

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:51.120
and it's illegal to
provide alcohol to minors,

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:53.920
unless they are your
children or grandchildren.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:55.350
- Please excuse my parents' behavior,

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.400
they ate a lot of paint chips growing up.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.770
- The Commonwealth Social
Host Law makes it illegal

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:02.770
